<title>INDONESIA: Indonesian palm oil market closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>Indonesian palm oil market closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesian palm oil market is closed on Wednesday for a Hindu holiday. Trading will resume on Thursday.</p>
<p>Palm olein was quoted at 1,390-1,405 rupiah/kg in Jakarta on Tuesday, while crude palm oil was stable at 1,225 rupiah/kg in North Sumatran city of Medan.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta Newsroom + 6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
